From 6d9728f52eb096199c4ace208435c8b8927e5140 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:15:57 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] docs(readme): name the default WARSHA_LLM_* base URL

The environment path falls back to https://router.sayl.site/v1 when
WARSHA_LLM_BASE_URL is unset, so an exported key would be sent to a host the
reader did not choose. Say so beside the path that reads it.
---
 README.ar.md | 2 +-
 README.md    | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

